{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638840/extras/logo_small.png?t=1761202357\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, new exorcists, to <strong>Tales of Yokai Harmony</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique puzzle adventure where Sokoban-style gameplay meets visual novel storytelling. Team up with yokai of the Five Elements to restore the balance of Yin and Yang in a mystical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a self-contained story experience, featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Complete Narrative Arc:</strong> Follow the story from its mysterious beginning to a satisfying conclusion in the included chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzle Gameplay:</strong> Challenge your wits with a series of intricately designed Sokoban-style puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Character Interaction:</strong> Get to know a charming cast of yokai through a rich visual novel presentation.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638840?t=1761202357","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638840?t=1761202357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638840/d8b673fb49efe197315ac5ff8f75316b3121cb97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761202357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638840/d8b673fb49efe197315ac5ff8f75316b3121cb97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761202357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"In the early story, there is a short scene where a mythical fox spirit (gumiho) is depicted bathing in a foggy lake. Partial nudity is shown, but sensitive areas are obscured through mist or camera framing. The scene is intended to convey mystique and narrative depth, not to provide sexual content. Other than this, the game maintains an all-ages tone with lighthearted conversations and exploration."},"demos":[{"appid":3778140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638840/extras/logo_small.png?t=1761202357\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, new exorcists, to <strong>Tales of Yokai Harmony</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique puzzle adventure where Sokoban-style gameplay meets visual novel storytelling. Team up with yokai of the Five Elements to restore the balance of Yin and Yang in a mystical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a self-contained story experience, featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Complete Narrative Arc:</strong> Follow the story from its mysterious beginning to a satisfying conclusion in the included chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzle Gameplay:</strong> Challenge your wits with a series of intricately designed Sokoban-style puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Character Interaction:</strong> Get to know a charming cast of yokai through a rich visual novel presentation.</p></li></ul>","developers":["YokaiAttic"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638840/f9dc2aeb8d34d7293b62f9525a5c558681c1ac74/header.jpg?t=1761202357","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"